{"id":"46fcf149df5dcc70","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-hypergraph.md","title":"Finite hypergraph","display":"df-hypergraph — Finite hypergraph","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-hypergraph","aliases":["27-df-hypergraph"],"display":"df-hypergraph — Finite hypergraph","depends_on":[],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"Appendix A.3","source_statement":"Finite fragment of hypergraph / set system","source_printed_pages":"614","source_pdf_pages":"638","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-hypergraph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-hypergraph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hypergraph — Finite hypergraph"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Appendix A.3"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Finite fragment of hypergraph / set system"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"614"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"638"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=(V,\\mathcal E)\">\\(H=(V,\\mathcal E)\\)</span> 为集合的有序对；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(V)\">\\(\\mathcal P(V)\\)</span> 为幂集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hypergraph}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hypergraph}\\)</span> 是本节定义的一元谓词符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hypergraph}(H)\\Longleftrightarrow|V|&lt;\\infty\\land\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Hypergraph}(H)\\Longleftrightarrow|V|&lt;\\infty\\land\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书 Appendix A.3 的有限 set-system 片段。空顶点集和空 hyperedge 均允许；当全部边大小为 2 时就是有限 simple graph。本文只定义 Hypergraph 谓词，未假定所给 pair 已满足条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"H=(V,\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hypergraph}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hypergraph}(H)\\Longleftrightarrow|V|<\\infty\\land\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(V).","display":true}],"bytes":1248,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-237","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-hypergraph|df-hypergraph — Finite hypergraph]]"}],"outgoing":[]}